[{"client_msg_id":"523add32-a27f-4d0a-941a-74c6c63e4456","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"デパートはもともとブラック体質あるから。会員カードの勧誘ノルマで家族やその親しい友人関係まで声がけが回ってきた事例が…","ts":"1635674430.101100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tsurai_orange","count":5,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U7JL1UKKL","UFHQ7TNT0","U01BY3SDBRS","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pjM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D153FC64-F8D9-4292-8D11-6AA3988034D8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"デパート業界がなかなか酷いって話でしたっけ？","ts":"1635659622.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"faYvv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0d5b17d-0d8d-4516-a96f-91fba7b2a9b9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分も無理に出るなというのが普通の所でよかった(うっかり軽症のときに出て、まわりごと休むことはなくなかなったけど)","ts":"1635658079.094900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uCF0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b229fb7-c2e0-40e0-8996-8f6074ce216b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分は遭遇したことがないので幸運","ts":"1635657534.092500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tQ5o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb96e0cd-7569-42c4-9ee3-76ff583e31dc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普通に休めますけどねえ...安全を取るのは、リモートになってわりと普通になった所もあるんじゃないかな(うっかりすると38度あってもチャットできちゃうからこそ)","ts":"1635657530.092300","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1635657537.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y1kou"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd5c0fb6-3c7b-4285-a352-607d5f30e64d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"世の中にはインフル陽性とかでも強制出勤させて無駄に被害拡大するとかそんなケースあるからな…(とおいめ)","ts":"1635657528.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zZR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46b74b74-4630-41da-ab3b-369a72677685","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど…そこに全く抵抗がないな","ts":"1635657508.091100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gdc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c783a898-98e2-4405-b7ef-ba3d2001b049","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"症状も出ないうちから休むのに抵抗感ある人結構いるからなぁ","ts":"1635657491.090300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5mM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"980d9611-5a82-465a-b1a8-1f82d874484d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"逆にそれで休ませないは制度上おかしい気がする","ts":"1635657483.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8MtR5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cb9f0d7-5533-4aa7-af79-81a0e5958c83","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"多分頭おかしい所以外では大事を取って休むのは通用すると思うけども","ts":"1635657464.089500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ifnv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20233131-ec32-44a5-89ea-0db6a233820f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"コロナワクチンは合法では…?","ts":"1635657454.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wsc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2841abf5-f109-4577-a1d8-51152d90d384","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何の罪悪感もなく合法的に休みたいとかそういうのでは","ts":"1635657430.088300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kzK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bd76d46-d383-4b4a-96dd-a22ee4649f56","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"(全日じゃないから全日高校の状況がわからない…)","ts":"1635657410.088000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nnaE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbe27e9d-944e-4cb9-a0ff-ecda4b7d6d00","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"コロナワクチン摂取したから大事をとって休みますじゃ通用しないのかな？","ts":"1635657379.087200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bjO="}]},{"client_msg_id":"26d6b62b-2667-4241-bf6c-60e8ad734b79","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"(昨日模試で休めなかったから明日ほどほどに副反応出てほしい)","ts":"1635653057.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","U01AQ5BFNLX","U01J7703PFT","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WdloH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AC37F4DC-AED5-4E7A-B2F2-232DFD2F022B","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"まる２日完全にポンコツと化すので妻に負担かけてしまうのがちょっと申し訳ない気持ち","ts":"1635651687.084900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"691ec6d2-ee2a-4343-8772-dd81f0417cab","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"悪化というか熱が上るとか、後から特定の症状は出るけど、ウィルスや細菌の増加による悪化みたいなのがない、ですね","ts":"1635651674.084600","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1635651690.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J7Qjj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"090f9eb6-251b-4bbf-b815-bea991d64837","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、症状の情報がそろって、(最初に出る状態から)悪化するわけではないので、気分は楽なんですけどね\n面倒なのは事実","ts":"1635651635.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ICv7Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bf4b093-a52c-4293-9b40-ad1317135eaf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"治るのが分かっているのであれば気持ち的には平気なのだけど前回慣れてなくてプラグインが書けないくらいダウンしてしまったからな","ts":"1635651574.082300","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1635651581.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cgz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b081ff44-0201-4f96-920e-92be489cf937","type":"message","user":"UGEQG12HJ","text":"10日ほど経ったけどそろそろランニング再開していいかしら","ts":"1635651534.081000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M9hAv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4ee6800-b01a-4bb2-a547-3074feb8711b","type":"message","user":"UGEQG12HJ","text":"ファイザーだったからか副反応は弱めだったけど、あんまり風邪引き慣れてないから流石に3回目はちょっと憂鬱ですね","ts":"1635651514.080700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BmfX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38ed1390-5003-409e-afd6-8af2d3e3f103","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"もし三回目やるとしたらモデルナになるのかな","ts":"1635650765.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I41"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B9C617BD-6C23-47F3-BC2E-FD1BF6318050","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ニュースで3回目の副反応は2回目と同じくらいというのは見ましたね","ts":"1635650512.078800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K4Awh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a177f44d-dfb4-4e7a-9b20-c42dfc811a39","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"時間置くし、大分ちがうだろうとは思うけど...どうなんだろうね","ts":"1635650371.078000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TpB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9F8EFE5C-2D7F-453C-9D76-291ADBE4CFB3","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"3回目ってやるの確定してたんですね\n2回目の副反応ムッチャきつかったから3回目とても不安","ts":"1635649908.077300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Oso"}]},{"client_msg_id":"165C29CD-02A1-4570-97A2-6EB71A943E25","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"3回目、2回目から8ヶ月後らしいから自分は6月くらいですね。また自治体は予約できなくて自衛隊とかになるのかな","ts":"1635647983.075700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gKx5"}]